                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>فَمَنْ اَظْلَمُ مِمَّنْ كَذَبَ عَلَيْ اللَهِ وَكَذَّبَ بِالصِّدْقِ </incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#14v">-14v</locus> مَنْ عَمِلَ صَالِحاً فَلِنَفْسِهِ وَمَنْ أَسَأَ فَعَلَيْهَا وَمَا رَبُّكَ بِظَلَّامٍ لِّلْعَبِيْدِ</explicit>
                     <note>39:32-41:46. Titles of suras rubricated. Red commas as verse markers. Ǧuz' marker in red on fol. 1v in the margin. Some extensions of words to meet the margin line. Words repeatedly left incomplete at the end of a line and completed on the following line. Signs to complete the line and meet the margin, then next word written on the following line (4r, 5v). Few corrections in the margin, one of them was deleted (3r).</note>
